        <mxCell id="map" value="Struktur sub-modul MD (10) — lihat diagram terpisah per sub-modul:&lt;br&gt;1. SOP — syn_sop&lt;br&gt;2. Form Template — m_form_template&lt;br&gt;3. Formula Library — m_formula (+_version, _validation)&lt;br&gt;4. Uncertainty Template — m_uncertainty_template (+_component)&lt;br&gt;5. Tolerance Master — m_tolerance&lt;br&gt;6. Conversion Table — m_conversion_table&lt;br&gt;7. Calibrator / Reference Tool — syn_calibrator&lt;br&gt;8. Sertifikat / Standar Acuan — syn_certificate&lt;br&gt;9. Media Kalibrasi — syn_media&lt;br&gt;10. Master Umum — syn_location / syn_department / syn_manufacturer" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=18;dashed=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#475569;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
